@startuml visualization_module_diagram
title Frontend - Visualization module diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

package "Page composition" {
  class PatternPage
  class CollapsiblePanel
}

package "Visualization components" {
  class ExecutionScene
  class UmlDiagram
  class VisualizationModal
  class ZoomableViewport
}

package "Static content" {
  class patternLearningContent
  class patternUmlDiagrams
}

package "Utility layer" {
  class playgroundUtils <<utils>>
}

PatternPage --> CollapsiblePanel
PatternPage --> ExecutionScene
PatternPage --> UmlDiagram
PatternPage --> playgroundUtils
PatternPage --> patternLearningContent
PatternPage --> patternUmlDiagrams

VisualizationModal --> ExecutionScene
VisualizationModal --> UmlDiagram
ExecutionScene --> ZoomableViewport
UmlDiagram --> ZoomableViewport

note right of ExecutionScene
Rendu runtime du pattern :
- scene SVG
- variations par pattern
- mode compact / modal
- apercu live vs derniere execution
end note

note right of UmlDiagram
Rendu structurel :
- layout par pattern
- couleurs semantiques
- zoom / pan
- modal grand format
end note

@enduml
